2117
00:03:27,067 --> 00:03:31,647
<i>So not all of his personality as Vincent has been lost.</i>

2118
00:03:32,607 --> 00:03:33,817
<i>However...</i>

2119
00:03:34,237 --> 00:03:37,987
Does Vincent Law also intend to kill the Bureau Chief?

2120
00:03:42,997 --> 00:03:44,247
Where are you going?

2121
00:03:45,837 --> 00:03:48,457
I am his Entourage.

2122
00:03:48,457 --> 00:03:51,717
My duty is to protect and guide him.

2123
00:03:56,137 --> 00:03:57,677
I see.

2124
00:04:06,187 --> 00:04:10,187
meditation  shackles

2125
00:04:06,187 --> 00:04:10,187
meditation  shackles

2126
00:04:27,877 --> 00:04:30,337
Where are you, Papa?

2127
00:04:31,547 --> 00:04:33,087
Grandfather,

2128
00:04:33,667 --> 00:04:35,797
Romdeau is finished.

2129
00:04:37,177 --> 00:04:38,507
I...

2130
00:04:39,347 --> 00:04:42,057
always hated this city.

2131
00:04:48,767 --> 00:04:50,937
A world full of lies.

2132
00:04:52,187 --> 00:04:55,197
But this is truth.

2133
00:04:57,907 --> 00:05:02,367
If so, then what I've been seeking is too...

2134
00:05:15,007 --> 00:05:16,507
You are...

2135
00:05:19,597 --> 00:05:22,677
Nice to meet you, my other self.

2136
00:05:23,137 --> 00:05:25,267
Who are you?

2137
00:05:25,267 --> 00:05:26,477
I?

2138
00:05:26,477 --> 00:05:28,897
I am Re-l Mayer.

2139
00:05:28,897 --> 00:05:30,607
I am Re-l Mayer!

2140
00:05:30,897 --> 00:05:32,227
Not you.

2141
00:05:34,277 --> 00:05:35,487
Stop!

2142
00:05:37,027 --> 00:05:39,197
Don't do such sad things.

2143
00:05:39,867 --> 00:05:42,617
You are the one who helped Vincent remember me...

2144
00:05:42,907 --> 00:05:45,367
remember Monad.

2145
00:05:48,957 --> 00:05:50,627
What are you talking about?

2146
00:05:50,627 --> 00:05:52,377
What's this "Monad"?

2147
00:05:52,377 --> 00:05:54,417
What's that got to do with me?

2148
00:05:55,507 --> 00:05:58,377
And why do you know Vincent?

2149
00:05:59,297 --> 00:06:02,467
He does not have to suffer any longer.

2150
00:06:03,097 --> 00:06:05,807
I want to save him.

2151
00:06:06,307 --> 00:06:08,477
Save him from the Creator's suffering.

2152
00:06:09,437 --> 00:06:11,397
The Creator's suffering?

2153
00:06:11,397 --> 00:06:14,107
<i>He</i> is the one who created Romdeau.

2154
00:06:15,317 --> 00:06:17,487
Don't tell her things she doesn't need to know.

2155
00:06:20,027 --> 00:06:20,907
Re-l,

2156
00:06:21,657 --> 00:06:23,327
I've been looking for you.

2157
00:06:24,697 --> 00:06:26,327
Daedalus.

2158
00:06:26,327 --> 00:06:28,657
So the Administrator did die.

2159
00:06:29,117 --> 00:06:31,877
No wonder I was allowed to enter.

2160
00:06:32,457 --> 00:06:35,167
Vincent created this city?

2161
00:06:35,877 --> 00:06:37,007
Yes.

2162
00:06:37,587 --> 00:06:39,427
Ask them.

2163
00:06:39,427 --> 00:06:41,297
Now that the Administrator is dead,

2164
00:06:41,297 --> 00:06:45,557
those stone statues have no further reason to keep their silence.

2165
00:06:47,177 --> 00:06:48,557
Who is she?

2166
00:06:49,557 --> 00:06:51,847
I told you not to wander around.

2167
00:06:52,687 --> 00:06:57,067
Daedalus, I want to see Vincent.

2168
00:06:57,067 --> 00:06:57,937
What?

2169
00:06:58,487 --> 00:07:01,607
I want to see Vincent.

2170
00:07:02,277 --> 00:07:03,777
You too?

2171
00:07:06,287 --> 00:07:07,287
Re-l!

2172
00:07:08,827 --> 00:07:11,457
Re-l, go back to the lab.

2173
00:07:12,627 --> 00:07:13,787
Cut the crap!

2174
00:07:14,087 --> 00:07:16,627
Vincent killed Grandfather.

2175
00:07:16,627 --> 00:07:18,757
Is that who he really is?

2176
00:07:20,507 --> 00:07:22,547
Then what should I do?

2177
00:07:23,137 --> 00:07:26,467
If he ceases to be himself, I...

2178
00:07:27,387 --> 00:07:29,887
And yet, Daedalus, even you...

2179
00:07:29,887 --> 00:07:30,977
I don't know!

2180
00:07:31,727 --> 00:07:33,897
He killed the Administrator, didn't he?

2181
00:07:33,897 --> 00:07:35,977
Then kill Vincent!

2182
00:07:36,397 --> 00:07:38,437
Vincent, Vincent...

2183
00:07:38,437 --> 00:07:39,647
It's always about him!

2184
00:07:43,657 --> 00:07:45,067
Oh, right...

2185
00:07:45,657 --> 00:07:47,737
I have to find my Re-l.

2186
00:07:47,737 --> 00:07:48,867
Daedalus...

2187
00:07:50,997 --> 00:07:54,957
I want my Re-l to see only me.

2188
00:08:02,087 --> 00:08:06,047
Please tell me what truths you know.

2189
00:08:06,797 --> 00:08:08,007
Re-l.

2190
00:08:09,217 --> 00:08:11,017
The truth...

2191
00:08:11,017 --> 00:08:14,347
would mean Romdeau's demise.

2192
00:08:14,977 --> 00:08:22,277
Did Vincent... Did Ergo PROXY return to this city to witness that?

2193
00:08:22,607 --> 00:08:26,617
We cannot discern what is in the Creator's mind.

2194
00:08:26,987 --> 00:08:30,487
Did Vincent really create this city?

2195
00:08:30,487 --> 00:08:31,827
This dome...

2196
00:08:31,827 --> 00:08:35,247
and several dozen beings on which the citizens were based.

2197
00:08:35,787 --> 00:08:39,087
The rest came from Womb System
 maintenance and increased production...

2198
00:08:39,087 --> 00:08:40,377
Correct.

2199
00:08:41,957 --> 00:08:46,427
I have seen many domes in the outside world.

2200
00:08:47,137 --> 00:08:52,307
So those domes were also created by individual PROXIES...

2201
00:08:54,437 --> 00:08:56,897
PROXIES are gods.

2202
00:08:56,897 --> 00:09:00,567
And Romdeau is a utopia abandoned by God.

2203
00:09:01,027 --> 00:09:02,607
Abandoned?

2204
00:09:02,607 --> 00:09:05,237
Ergo left.

2205
00:09:05,237 --> 00:09:08,447
Along with a deep disappointment in himself.

2206
00:09:08,447 --> 00:09:11,407
Donov Mayer was entrusted.

2207
00:09:11,407 --> 00:09:13,617
Grandfather was... by Ergo?

2208
00:09:14,577 --> 00:09:18,457
Why did a PROXY, said to be omnipotent, abandon the city?

2209
00:09:18,957 --> 00:09:21,377
Why is this world rife with chaos?

2210
00:09:21,377 --> 00:09:25,127
It means PROXIES are not omnipotent.

2211
00:09:25,757 --> 00:09:29,547
To Romdeau, Ergo is indeed God.

2212
00:09:29,847 --> 00:09:32,717
An imperfect god, however.

2213
00:09:32,717 --> 00:09:36,977
That which is created by such a god is also imperfect.

2214
00:09:38,097 --> 00:09:41,477
And God abandoned us...

2215
00:09:41,767 --> 00:09:44,067
left us to live.

2216
00:09:45,187 --> 00:09:49,027
Then why did Romdeau invade Mosk?

2217
00:09:49,027 --> 00:09:52,327
Melancholy stemming from loss of glory and grandeur.

2218
00:09:52,327 --> 00:09:55,197
The ultimate revenge.

2219
00:09:55,197 --> 00:10:01,957
But Monad took our sight and shut
 us tightly away with her closed eyes.

2220
00:10:01,957 --> 00:10:06,337
So our eyes no longer shine upon the land.

2221
00:10:06,337 --> 00:10:07,587
Do you understand?

2222
00:10:07,587 --> 00:10:09,797
What irony.

2223
00:10:09,797 --> 00:10:14,517
The Creator had returned unbeknownst to us.

2224
00:10:15,467 --> 00:10:17,517
An imperfect god...

2225
00:10:18,517 --> 00:10:20,097
We are...

2226
00:10:25,277 --> 00:10:26,357
<i>It can't be...</i>

2227
00:10:26,357 --> 00:10:27,857
<i>We are...</i>

2228
00:10:29,027 --> 00:10:31,317
The Creator's suffering...

2229
00:10:37,037 --> 00:10:39,207
Please don't suffer anymore.

2230
00:10:40,707 --> 00:10:43,997
Come to me, Vincent.

2231
00:10:46,127 --> 00:10:49,677
I will free you from the prison of suffering.

2232
00:11:08,487 --> 00:11:10,027
Re-l Mayer!

2233
00:11:18,157 --> 00:11:19,537
It can't be.

2234
00:11:37,717 --> 00:11:38,557
Here you go.

2235
00:11:38,887 --> 00:11:41,307
I did what you asked, didn't I?

2236
00:11:41,307 --> 00:11:42,187
Yes.

2237
00:11:42,517 --> 00:11:44,557
Daedalus Yumeno...

2238
00:11:45,897 --> 00:11:47,937
You're still alive?

2239
00:11:47,937 --> 00:11:49,857
You're surprisingly tough.

2240
00:11:49,857 --> 00:11:51,857
Where are the FP bullets?

2241
00:11:51,857 --> 00:11:53,067
Give me all of them.

2242
00:11:53,407 --> 00:11:54,737
Sure.

2243
00:11:54,737 --> 00:11:56,367
Take as many as you'd like.

2244
00:11:56,367 --> 00:11:57,867
Where did you hide them?!

2245
00:11:57,867 --> 00:11:59,077
No idea.

2246
00:11:59,077 --> 00:11:59,947
I forgot.

2247
00:12:04,417 --> 00:12:07,207
Oh, I remember now. I threw them away.

2248
00:12:16,847 --> 00:12:17,597
You bastard!

2249
00:12:17,597 --> 00:12:18,757
Why?!

2250
00:12:18,757 --> 00:12:21,177
Because we don't need them anymore.

2251
00:12:21,177 --> 00:12:23,057
I have to kill him... kill Vincent Law.

2252
00:12:23,057 --> 00:12:25,807
I have to kill him... kill Vincent Law.

2253
00:12:27,897 --> 00:12:30,857
All I care about is having Re-l.

2254
00:12:31,817 --> 00:12:33,857
You intend to turn your back on reality

2255
00:12:33,857 --> 00:12:37,317
and wait for death with Re-l Mayer's replacement?

2256
00:12:38,327 --> 00:12:41,077
"Model citizens should throw things away."

2257
00:12:41,867 --> 00:12:43,707
I don't need you anymore either.

2258
00:12:43,997 --> 00:12:44,867
What?

2259
00:12:44,867 --> 00:12:49,417
You'll only be pathetic if you live any longer, Chief Raul.

2260
00:12:49,917 --> 00:12:51,337
It won't be beautiful.

2261
00:12:52,087 --> 00:12:54,337
I will not succumb.

2262
00:12:55,177 --> 00:12:57,217
I will fight to the very end!

2263
00:12:57,847 --> 00:12:59,217
As you wish.

2264
00:13:14,987 --> 00:13:16,447
Shoot 'im!

2265
00:13:23,827 --> 00:13:29,497
<i>"Vincent" is a personality he created so he could forget</i>

2266
00:13:29,497 --> 00:13:31,247
<i>that he is a PROXY.</i>

2267
00:13:34,007 --> 00:13:36,627
You said you wouldn't shoot for now.

2268
00:13:37,507 --> 00:13:39,637
So, I'm returning it to you.

2269
00:13:40,967 --> 00:13:43,097
Let's go together, Miss Re-l.

2270
00:13:47,387 --> 00:13:49,187
That an immigrant like me...

2271
00:13:49,187 --> 00:13:50,607
No, that's not it.

2272
00:13:51,147 --> 00:13:53,107
That a monster like me...

2273
00:13:54,937 --> 00:13:56,237
<i>Vincent.</i>

2274
00:13:56,897 --> 00:14:01,027
<i>Did Romdeau continue to reject you, its Creator,</i>

2275
00:14:01,027 --> 00:14:03,947
<i>because you subconsciously wished it to be so?</i>

2276
00:14:05,407 --> 00:14:07,747
<i>Because you had made it so?</i>

2277
00:14:10,577 --> 00:14:16,007
<i>If everything was a setup, when you appeared before me</i>

2278
00:14:16,377 --> 00:14:18,377
<i>was Romdeau supposed to collapse?</i>

2279
00:14:18,377 --> 00:14:20,967
<i>Was it to make me kill you?</i>

2280
00:14:22,347 --> 00:14:25,267
<i>Was that why I was created?</i>

2281
00:14:27,097 --> 00:14:30,267
<i>And why you appeared...</i>

2282
00:14:31,187 --> 00:14:34,897
<i>and why I was helplessly drawn to you.</i>

2283
00:14:37,237 --> 00:14:39,447
But why me?

2284
00:14:42,317 --> 00:14:44,827
This is true for you too...

2285
00:14:46,327 --> 00:14:47,447
No one...

2286
00:14:47,447 --> 00:14:50,827
No one can choose whom they will be when they're born.

2287
00:14:52,167 --> 00:14:54,627
No matter what manner of being they are...

2288
00:14:56,917 --> 00:14:59,217
Isn't that right, Vincent?

2289
00:15:02,297 --> 00:15:03,717
But now...

2290
00:15:03,717 --> 00:15:06,717
I feel as though my heart might shatter.

2291
00:15:07,517 --> 00:15:13,397
The ones who supported my existence disappear one by one.

2292
00:15:14,767 --> 00:15:15,857
Re-l.

2293
00:15:17,527 --> 00:15:20,737
This may be the truth for Romdeau,

2294
00:15:20,737 --> 00:15:24,117
but it is not the truth you should arrive at.

2295
00:15:25,987 --> 00:15:28,577
The truth <i>I</i> should arrive at?

2296
00:15:28,577 --> 00:15:31,827
That truth should not be something told to you by another,

2297
00:15:31,827 --> 00:15:34,457
but should come from within.

2298
00:15:34,457 --> 00:15:37,247
It does not matter who tells you the truth,

2299
00:15:37,247 --> 00:15:40,717
it is <i>you</i> who must discover the truth for yourself.

2300
00:15:41,627 --> 00:15:47,217
So there is a different truth for each of us?

2301
00:15:48,557 --> 00:15:51,597
Re-l, we have nothing more to say to you.

2302
00:15:51,597 --> 00:15:54,607
As long as evil and shame continue to exist...

2303
00:15:54,607 --> 00:15:57,727
Silence is our only joy.

2304
00:15:57,727 --> 00:16:00,487
Do not awaken us...

2305
00:16:00,487 --> 00:16:02,607
Until the end...

2306
00:16:04,357 --> 00:16:05,987
Leave us in peace...

2307
00:16:54,617 --> 00:16:55,917
Papa?

2308
00:17:02,127 --> 00:17:04,087
<i>My truth...</i>

2309
00:17:05,427 --> 00:17:10,057
<i>Something bore down on me... something other than terror.</i>

2310
00:17:10,967 --> 00:17:14,767
<i>Every time I faced you, it became larger.</i>

2311
00:17:16,597 --> 00:17:18,557
<i>But that was...</i>

2312
00:17:48,507 --> 00:17:50,097
It tickles.

2313
00:17:51,467 --> 00:17:53,767
You protected me, didn't you.

2314
00:17:55,017 --> 00:17:58,017
Because that man said he'd kill him.

2315
00:18:14,907 --> 00:18:16,617
Hey, Papa.

2316
00:18:18,287 --> 00:18:21,837
Pino has lots of feelings.

2317
00:18:24,837 --> 00:18:27,917
I'm happy sometimes and sad sometimes...

2318
00:18:27,917 --> 00:18:29,377
Lots of feelings!

2319
00:18:30,337 --> 00:18:33,137
I'm going far, far away.

2320
00:18:36,137 --> 00:18:38,807
But after leaving you,

2321
00:18:38,807 --> 00:18:41,187
I realized what it's like to miss you, Papa.

2322
00:18:43,187 --> 00:18:46,567
You have a lot of feelings too, don't you?

2323
00:18:50,737 --> 00:18:53,487
Can I... still see her?

2324
00:18:56,447 --> 00:18:57,577
Papa...

2325
00:18:57,997 --> 00:19:02,247
Would you miss me too, Papa?

2326
00:20:29,667 --> 00:20:31,467
Donov Mayer...

2327
00:20:36,717 --> 00:20:38,347
Vincent...

2328
00:20:38,347 --> 00:20:40,927
No, Ergo PROXY...

2329
00:20:43,477 --> 00:20:45,647
Have you regained your memories?

2330
00:20:46,347 --> 00:20:47,357
Yes.

2331
00:20:47,937 --> 00:20:50,317
I created this city.

2332
00:20:51,317 --> 00:20:54,447
I entrusted all of it to this man.

2333
00:20:54,947 --> 00:20:56,697
Why did you come back?

2334
00:20:57,197 --> 00:21:00,077
You knew I would turn the gun on you.

2335
00:21:01,617 --> 00:21:02,997
That's why.

2336
00:21:04,617 --> 00:21:07,167
You're going to kill me, aren't you?

2337
00:21:08,247 --> 00:21:10,587
You believe I'll pull the trigger?

2338
00:21:12,257 --> 00:21:14,627
If you wish it.

2339
00:21:23,427 --> 00:21:24,427
Why?

2340
00:21:24,937 --> 00:21:27,267
Don't think I'll do what you want.

2341
00:21:27,807 --> 00:21:30,267
I will not be manipulated by you.

2342
00:21:32,817 --> 00:21:37,407
That is <i>my</i> truth... the one I finally arrived at.

2343
00:21:38,947 --> 00:21:40,947
The message left for me in Mosk.

2344
00:21:41,237 --> 00:21:42,447
The two necklaces...

2345
00:21:43,287 --> 00:21:44,537
That which has been separated.

2346
00:21:46,287 --> 00:21:49,627
You have shown yourself to us many times.

2347
00:21:52,127 --> 00:21:53,627
You're listening, aren't you?

2348
00:21:56,417 --> 00:22:00,007
Vincent Law and Ergo PROXY...

2349
00:22:00,637 --> 00:22:04,217
Having lost his memories and possessing two personalities...

2350
00:22:04,217 --> 00:22:07,227
Vincent was the perfect disguise for you.

2351
00:22:08,057 --> 00:22:12,897
But my truth has revealed your existence,

2352
00:22:13,357 --> 00:22:18,907
the other shadow manipulating Vincent and Ergo PROXY.

2353
00:22:20,867 --> 00:22:22,657
Show yourself!

2354
00:22:23,157 --> 00:22:25,287
You're still nearby, aren't you?

2355
00:22:35,587 --> 00:22:40,637
Impressive, Re-l124C41.

2356
00:23:00,067 --> 00:23:02,407
It is your turn to find the truth.

2357
00:23:39,987 --> 00:23:44,157
So you have finally arrived, Vincent Law.

2358
00:23:44,657 --> 00:23:49,247
But can you escape... from this labyrinth?

